{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:0.4"], "en": "2. The Keḷisīla Jātaka “Swans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:1.1"], "en": "curlews, and peacocks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:1.2"], "en": "elephants, antelopes, and deer;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:1.3"], "en": "All fear the lion;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:1.4"], "en": "there is no equality in physical form.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:2.1"], "en": "Even so among humans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:2.2"], "en": "\"Even if he is young, if he possesses wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:2.3"], "en": "he is indeed great therein;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:2.4"], "en": "the fool, though possessing a body, is not so.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_202:3.1"], "en": "The Keḷisīla-jātaka, the second.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
